# Convex conventions

- Import `query`/`mutation`/`action`/`internal*` from `./_generated/server`; `api`/`internal` from `./_generated/api`.
- Index by `orgId` (+ status). Never unbounded `.collect()` on growing tables — use `.withIndex` + `.take`/paginate.
- `"use node"` only in action-only modules; never mix with queries/mutations.
- AgentMail webhook via component `handleWebhook`; Firecrawl via `FirecrawlClient` from actions.
- LLM drafts in actions: AgentRouter (`https://agentrouter.org/v1`) or Convex AI Gateway; never invent prices.
- Reserved JS names are forbidden as export names (`delete`, `new`, …).
